      "value": "I'm shocked this doesn't have more attention, I have more friends who have expressed interest in something like this than the number of upvotes this thread has. \n\nSome people are really overly clingy and awkward even though I consider them friends. I don't want people like that just dropping in on me any time I'm on blue/green, and it's why I'm on orange most of the time. I'd be on blue/green almost all the time if I could keep my more clingy friends on a join-by-request basis.",
